        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} {e ^ {\\prime} (t) + 3 e (t)} & {= [ e ^ {- t} u (t) ] ^ {\\prime} + 3 e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\\\ & {= - e ^ {- t} u (t) + e ^ {- t} d (t) + 3 e ^ {- t} u (t)} \\\\ & {= 2 e ^ {- t} u (t) + d (t)} \\end{array}\n$$",
