    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "考点 1: $0_{-}$ 到 $0_{+}$ 状态",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            138,
            381,
            156
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "信号在0时刻加λ",
        "bbox": [
            80,
            153,
            319,
            185
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "0- : 加入3前的瞬时",
        "bbox": [
            92,
            178,
            347,
            211
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "${D}_{ + } : {DA}\\lambda$ 之后的n等时",
        "bbox": [
            97,
            211,
            352,
            245
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/7caea604bd1bb7dcc204970123704ef5d0b534bc27778a4cff2b49a3a8550cac.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            400,
            167,
            591,
            244
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$n$ 向应区间： $[D_{+}, +\\infty)$",
        "bbox": [
            613,
            165,
            873,
            205
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、定义及物理意义",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            248,
            347,
            264
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "由于激励信号的作用, 响应 $r\\left( t\\right)$ 及其各阶导数有可能在 $t = 0$ 时刻发生跳变, 为区分跳变前后的状态, 以 ${0}_{ - }$ 表示激励接入之前的瞬时, 以 ${0}_{ + }$ 表示激励接入以后的瞬时。与此对应, 给出 ${0}_{ - }$ 时刻和 ${0}_{ + }$ 时刻的两组状态, 即",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            271,
            811,
            339
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr ^ {(k)} (0 _ {-}) = \\left[ r (0 _ {-}), \\frac {d r (0 _ {-})}{d t}, \\dots , \\frac {d ^ {n - 1} r (0 _ {-})}{d t ^ {n - 1}} \\right]\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            289,
            340,
            687,
            385
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "称这组状态为“0\\_状态”或“起始状态”。它包含了为计算未来响应所需要的过去全部信息。另一组状态是",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            388,
            810,
            429
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr ^ {(k)} (0 _ {+}) = \\left[ r (0 _ {+}), \\frac {d r (0 _ {+})}{d t}, \\dots , \\frac {d ^ {n - 1} r (0 _ {+})}{d t ^ {n - 1}} \\right]\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            312,
            433,
            678,
            473
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "这组状态被称为“0+状态”或“初始状态”，也可称为“导出的起始状态”。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            479,
            727,
            496
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2、响应区间",
        "text_level": 2,
        "bbox": [
            184,
            504,
            292,
            519
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "用时域经典法求得微分方程的响应具体限于 $0_{+}<t<\\infty$ 的时间范围。根据 $0_{+}$ 状态的数据求得完全响应中的待定系数。",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            527,
            811,
            571
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3、连续时间系统经典法求解系统响应的完整流程：",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            599,
            586,
            616
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/d96c7fa9e01275bac765e4ca68cae3a31e8606967498c59efe54224c8915684c.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
