    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "天地： $r^{k_{1}}(0_{+}) = r^{k_{1}(0_{-})}$",
        "bbox": [
            673,
            676,
            884,
            712
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "有 $B$ 长： $r^{(1)}(u) = r^{(k)}(u) + a_k$",
        "bbox": [
            675,
            716,
            926,
            751
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "学习目标：（1）跳不？",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            805,
            376,
            824
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{l} {r (u _ {+}) = r (u _ {-}) + a _ {0}} \\\\ {r ^ {\\prime} (u _ {+}) = r ^ {\\prime} (u _ {-}) + a _ {1}} \\\\ {\\mathrm{求明}} \\end{array}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            737,
            745,
            921,
            824
        ],
        "page_idx": 1
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "一阶程 $\\Rightarrow$ 一条数 $\\Rightarrow r(0+)$ 值 $= r(0-)$ 值 $+a_{0}$",
