    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "4、 $0_{-}$ 到 $0_{+}$ 状态跳变的图形化解释",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            108,
            460,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/edf0eb9a4b7ea990d45d94d26a212307fcf88a7167478633bff0bcd9083f507c.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            80,
            95,
            929,
            292
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$2^{0}t(u(t))$ 在 $t=0$ 时连续的 $\\frac{1}{r_{0}}r(t)=t\\Delta u(t)$ $\\Rightarrow$ 说明在0时刻无二次变量(也可 $r(u+1)=r(u-1)$ )",
        "bbox": [
            124,
            290,
            934,
            362
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "用 $\\Delta u(t)$ 表示跳变，前面的系数表示跳变量。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            377,
            531,
            394
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "二所\n↓ $n(u_{+})$ 和 $vi(q)$ //    //    r(i) $n(u_{-})$ #",
        "bbox": [
            55,
            375,
            176,
            532
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n2 \\Delta u (t),\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            388,
            402,
            458,
            421
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\mathrm{即} r (0 _ {+}) =\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            726,
            402,
            810,
            419
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)若 ${r}^{\\prime }\\left( t\\right)$ 表达式中包含了 $- 2\\Delta u\\left( t\\right)$ ,说明 ${r}^{\\prime }\\left( t\\right)$ 从 ${0}_{ - }$ 到 ${0}_{ + }$ 有 -2 个跳变量,即 ${r}^{\\prime }\\left( {0}_{ + }\\right)  = {r}^{\\prime }\\left( {0}_{ - }\\right)  - 2$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            181,
            446,
            813,
            494
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(3)若 $r\\left( t\\right)$ 中包含 $t{\\Delta u}\\left( t\\right)$ ,则说明 ${0}_{ - }$ 和 ${0}_{ + }$ 连续,即 $r\\left( {0}_{ + }\\right)  = r\\left( {0}_{ - }\\right)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            497,
            690,
            521
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "中各自有多个 $\\triangle nht$ 和 $\\dot{n}ht$",
        "bbox": [
            52,
            534,
            174,
            638
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "目标: 已知 $r^{(k)}(0_{-})$ 求 $r^{(k)}(0_{+})$ 时, 关注各自表达式中 $\\Delta u(t)$ 前的系数",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            545,
            717,
            566
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$r^{(t)}$ 表式中各 $\\Delta u(t)$ 的幂 $\\Rightarrow$",
        "bbox": [
            321,
            568,
            675,
            600
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【新增】对冲激函数匹配的分析过程",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            641,
            485,
            657
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\frac{d}{dt} r(t) + 3r(t) = 2\\delta(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            386,
            659,
            598,
            711
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$1^{\\circ} r^{i}t$ 中含 $d^{i}t$",
        "bbox": [
            100,
            742,
            255,
            774
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
