        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1、 $0_{-}$ 到 $0_{+}$ 发生跳变的判断方法：将激励带入到方程右端，化简得自由项，若自由项中包含 $\\delta(t)$ 或 $\\delta(t)$ 的各阶导数，则 $0_{-}$ 到 $0_{+}$ 发生跳变。",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            135,
            808,
            181
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "否则未发生跳变, 即 $0 _ { \\text {状态} }$ 的值等于 $0 _ { + }$ 状态的值。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            187,
            581,
            205
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/3352b9bf274fab448204e9c49a5f3bd4b5d58b28df2f72cb0b1bfa7d298f0a88.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            761,
            157,
            867,
            218
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例8: 已知 $\\frac{d}{dt} r(t) + 2r(t) = e(t)$ , $r(0_{-}) = 1$ , $e(t) = u(t)$ , 求 $r(0_{+})$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            176,
            211,
            732,
            235
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "自由项为 $u(t) \\Rightarrow$ 无弧度 $\\Rightarrow n(u) = n(u-1) = 1$",
        "bbox": [
            226,
            235,
            658,
            264
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "image",
        "img_path": "images/0d15cefe2cff7e2339f0e2c5d00eb15b480c5463566bc619a2318a22b10f6762.jpg",
        "image_caption": [],
        "image_footnote": [],
        "content": "",
        "bbox": [
            62,
            301,
            176,
            495
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例9: 已知 $\\frac{d}{dt}r(t)+3r(t)=2\\frac{d}{dt}e(t), r(0_{-})=1, e(t)=u(t)$ ，求 $r(0_{+})$ 。 $r(t+3n-t)=20^{(t)}$",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            305,
            924,
            338
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$2{e}^{i\\left( t\\right) } = 2\\left( {\\sqrt{i}\\left( t\\right) }\\right)$ 的项 $\\Rightarrow$ 有弧线",
        "bbox": [
            242,
            336,
            542,
            366
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (t) + 3 n (t) = 2 \\sqrt {n (t)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            263,
            366,
            423,
            390
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\na = 2 \\Leftrightarrow r (t) = a (\\sqrt {t}) + b \\Delta u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            668,
            340,
            922,
            372
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例10: $r'(t) + 3r(t) = 2e'(t), e(t) = e(t), r(0_+) = 1$ , 求 $r(0_+)$ 。",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            388,
            724,
            432
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (t) = a \\Delta u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            736,
            376,
            862,
            400
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n2 e ^ {i t} = 2 \\sqrt {i t}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            225,
            435,
            374,
            461
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\Rightarrow r (u _ {+}) = r (u) + a = 3\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            761,
            400,
            934,
            425
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\Rightarrow  r(t) \\text{中有} 2 + \\delta(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            196,
            465,
            435,
            502
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (u +) = r (u -) - 6 = - 5\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            534,
            442,
            761,
            477
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\Rightarrow  {r|t}$ 中有 $2\\sqrt{r|t}$",
        "bbox": [
            196,
            505,
            418,
            536
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (t) + 3 r (t) = 2 \\sqrt {r (t)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            616,
            476,
            811,
            513
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\Rightarrow  {3n} + 1 + 2 = 3$",
        "bbox": [
            211,
            530,
            438,
            567
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr ^ {\\prime} (t) = a \\omega^ {\\prime} (t) + b \\omega^ {\\prime} (t) + c \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow a = 2\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            623,
            521,
            939,
            555
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\Rightarrow r(t)$ 中有 $-6\\sqrt{r(t)}$",
        "bbox": [
            206,
            568,
            450,
            603
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (t) = a \\sqrt {a (t)} + b \\Delta (w t) \\Rightarrow b + 3 a = 0 \\Rightarrow b = - 6\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            603,
            555,
            924,
            604
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$\\Rightarrow n(t)$ 中有 $-6\\Delta n(t)$",
        "bbox": [
            213,
            602,
            473,
            638
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\Rightarrow n (a) = n (0 - 1) + b = 1 - 6 = - 5\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            653,
            606,
            937,
            635
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
