    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n\\begin{array}{r l} & {y ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 2 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + y (t) = f ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 2 f (t)} \\\\ & {\\mathrm{已知} y (0 _ {-}) = 1, y ^ {\\prime} (0 _ {-}) = - 1, f (t) = u (t), \\mathrm{求} y (0 _ {+}) \\mathrm{和} y ^ {\\prime} (0 _ {+}).} \\\\ & {y ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) + 2 y ^ {\\prime} (t) + y (t) = 0 ^ {\\prime} (t) + 2 u (t)} \\\\ & {\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l l} {y ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) = a d ^ {\\prime} (t) + b d (t) + c \\Delta u (t)} & {\\Rightarrow a = 1} \\\\ {y (t) = a d (t) + b \\Delta u (t)} & {\\Rightarrow b + 2 a = 0 \\Rightarrow b = - 2} \\\\ {y (t) = a \\Delta u (t)} \\end{array} \\right.} \\\\ & {y (u _ {+}) = y (u _ {-}) + a = 1 + 1 = 2} \\\\ & {y ^ {\\prime} (u _ {+}) = y ^ {\\prime} (u _ {-}) + b = - 1 - 2 = - 3} \\\\ {\\mathrm{网:longxinkaoyan.com}} \\end{array}\n$$",
