    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "【梦马班点拨】0\\_到0\\_+跳变的补充说明",
        "bbox": [
            191,
            108,
            504,
            125
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (u _ {+}) = r (u _ {-}) + a _ {1} \\dots\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            689,
            108,
