        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "(2)重点关注 $\\Delta u(t)$ 前系数，表示所在表达式中 $0_{-}$ 到 $0_{+}$ 的跳变量，注意平衡时微分方程系数",
        "bbox": [
            184,
            185,
            900,
            204
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例 13: 已知 $r(0_{-}) = 1$ , $r'(0_{-}) = 2$ , $e(t) = u(t)$ ，求以下四个方程的 $0_{+}$ 值。",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            302,
            779,
            321
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "① $\\frac{d}{dt}r(t)+2r(t)=e(t)$ ，求 $r(0_{+})$",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            327,
            455,
            352
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "$u(t)$ 无不变 $\\Rightarrow r(u_{+}) = r(u_{-}) = 1$",
        "bbox": [
            231,
            355,
            613,
            385
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n② \\frac {d}{d t} r (t) + 3 r (t) = 2 \\frac {d}{d t} e (t), \\text {求} r (0 _ {+})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            426,
            484,
            453
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (t) + 3 r (t) = 2 \\sqrt {r (t)}\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            221,
            454,
            421,
            480
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (t) = a \\sqrt {t} + b \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow a = 2\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            512,
            435,
            836,
            467
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (t) = a \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow r (u _ {+}) = r (u) + a = 3\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            509,
            467,
            900,
            503
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\n③ \\frac {d ^ {2}}{d t ^ {2}} r (t) + \\frac {d}{d t} r (t) + r (t) = \\frac {d}{d t} e (t) + e (t), \\text {求} r (0 _ {+}) \\text {和} r ^ {\\prime} (0 _ {+})\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            183,
            524,
            655,
            554
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr ^ {\\prime} (t) + r ^ {\\prime} (t) + r (t) = \\delta (t) + u (t)\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            213,
            554,
            537,
            580
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr ^ {\\prime \\prime} (t) = a \\sqrt {r (t)} + b \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow a = 1\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            568,
            545,
            855,
            573
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr ^ {\\prime} (t) = a \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow r ^ {\\prime} (u + 1) = r ^ {\\prime} (v - 1) + a = 3\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            568,
            572,
            922,
            599
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
        "text": "$$\nr (t) = a t \\Delta u (t) \\Rightarrow r (v _ {+}) = r (v _ {-}) = 1\n$$",
        "text_format": "latex",
        "bbox": [
            571,
            599,
            917,
            629
        ],
        "page_idx": 5
    },
